              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " will not specifically overwrite any data that is removed from it,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "but also won't specifically preserve it. Its uninitialized memory is",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "scratch space that it may use however it wants. It will generally just do",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "whatever is most efficient or otherwise easy to implement. Do not rely on",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "removed data to be erased for security purposes. Even if you drop a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", its",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "buffer may simply be reused by another allocation. Even if you zero a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "'s memory",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "first, that might not actually happen because the optimizer does not consider",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "this a side-effect that must be preserved. There is one case which we will",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "not break, however: using ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "unsafe",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " code to write to the excess capacity,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and then increasing the length to match, is always valid.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Currently, ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " does not guarantee the order in which elements are dropped.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "The order has changed in the past and may change again.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "level": "SingleLine"
          }
        ]
